   "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkQ2RGUlRlVTlZVVRaVVkxcHFSV3R5WldFelZuYxAB!2m1!1s0x487bb1b92ee98029:0xb3d17be6d54f775"
  },
  {
   "name": "places/ChIJKYDpLrmxe0gRdfdUbb4XPQs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aZmFsWmhSMjF6WmtSRlVrNWxkREp0U2pWaGJGRRAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I’m absolutely delighted with my visit to the salon. The atmosphere was so warm, welcoming, and friendly, and I’m especially thrilled with my transformation by Dawid. ☺️\n\nDawid was incredibly helpful, professional, and kind throughout the whole appointment. For a few years, I had always worn a cool blonde because I was too afraid to try anything different. Thanks to his professional consultation and expert advice, he convinced me to go for a beautiful golden blonde shade and I couldn’t be happier with the result!\n\nThe change I had always been afraid of turned out to be the best decision I could have made. Thanks to Dawid’s professionalism and the trust he inspired, I now have the most beautiful hair I’ve ever had.\n\nI wholeheartedly recommend both the salon and Dawid. ☺️",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "I’m absolutely delighted with my visit to the salon. The atmosphere was so warm, welcoming, and friendly, and I’m especially thrilled with my transformation by Dawid. ☺️\n\nDawid was incredibly helpful, professional, and kind throughout the whole appointment. For a few years, I had always worn a cool blonde because I was too afraid to try anything different. Thanks to his professional consultation and expert advice, he convinced me to go for a beautiful golden blonde shade and I couldn’t be happier with the result!\n\nThe change I had always been afraid of turned out to be the best decision I could have made. Thanks to Dawid’s professionalism and the trust he inspired, I now have the most beautiful hair I’ve ever had.\n\nI wholeheartedly recommend both the salon and Dawid. ☺️",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
