   "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aZmFsWmhSMjF6WmtSRlVrNWxkREp0U2pWaGJGRRAB!2m1!1s0x487bb1b92ee98029:0xb3d17be6d54f775"
  },
  {
   "name": "places/ChIJKYDpLrmxe0gRdfdUbb4XPQs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1TmMyMUJXRGR2ZW5aUGNWaDVWM05wZVVRNWNtYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I hadn't been to a salon in years after getting used to cutting my own hair during covid... I then went to Melissa Timperley Hair Salon last week for a wash, styling cut and dry, and my experience was genuinely amazing!\n\nMillie was my stylist and did a fantastic job, she used a shampoo specific to my hair needs, and explained all of the products which were used. Let me also add that these products were high quality and from a sustainable brand. Following a short consultation on the cut I wanted, Millie delivered exactly what I had asked for and even showed me how to heat style my hair to achieve the look we used as inspiration.\n\nAll in all, it was an incredibly relaxing and lovely experience, and I would especially recommend if you are a nervous salon-goer!\n\nThanks so much Melissa and Millie x",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "I hadn't been to a salon in years after getting used to cutting my own hair during covid... I then went to Melissa Timperley Hair Salon last week for a wash, styling cut and dry, and my experience was genuinely amazing!\n\nMillie was my stylist and did a fantastic job, she used a shampoo specific to my hair needs, and explained all of the products which were used. Let me also add that these products were high quality and from a sustainable brand. Following a short consultation on the cut I wanted, Millie delivered exactly what I had asked for and even showed me how to heat style my hair to achieve the look we used as inspiration.\n\nAll in all, it was an incredibly relaxing and lovely experience, and I would especially recommend if you are a nervous salon-goer!\n\nThanks so much Melissa and Millie x",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
