   "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1TmMyMUJXRGR2ZW5aUGNWaDVWM05wZVVRNWNtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
   "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1TmMyMUJXRGR2ZW5aUGNWaDVWM05wZVVRNWNtYxAB!2m1!1s0x487bb1b92ee98029:0xb3d17be6d54f775"
  },
  {
   "name": "places/ChIJKYDpLrmxe0gRdfdUbb4XPQs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkSU1VcG9iM1J0V1RZek4zUkhhRkpJUzNoaU1tYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I came to Melissa feeling completely fed up with my hair. I was stuck in that awkward growing out stage after many disappointing haircuts and I didn’t even know what I wanted - I just knew it wasn’t the horrid mushroom cut I had.\n\nMelissa dedicated the whole appointment to me, looking at how my hair naturally behaves, the bits that drive me mental, and making sure the cut would actually work for me day to day, not just look good for five minutes when I left the salon.\n\nShe also spent loads of time showing me how to style it myself, both straight and curly. Usually I leave a salon with lovely hair and absolutely no clue how to recreate it at home.\n\nThe whole experience felt so personal and thoughtful.\n\nMelissa’s talent and skills are obvious and undeniable if you look are her work, but she's also just a genuinely lovely person who makes you feel completely comfortable. I’m really glad I booked. I feel like I’ve found my long time hairdresser!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "I came to Melissa feeling completely fed up with my hair. I was stuck in that awkward growing out stage after many disappointing haircuts and I didn’t even know what I wanted - I just knew it wasn’t the horrid mushroom cut I had.\n\nMelissa dedicated the whole appointment to me, looking at how my hair naturally behaves, the bits that drive me mental, and making sure the cut would actually work for me day to day, not just look good for five minutes when I left the salon.\n\nShe also spent loads of time showing me how to style it myself, both straight and curly. Usually I leave a salon with lovely hair and absolutely no clue how to recreate it at home.\n\nThe whole experience felt so personal and thoughtful.\n\nMelissa’s talent and skills are obvious and undeniable if you look are her work, but she's also just a genuinely lovely person who makes you feel completely comfortable. I’m really glad I booked. I feel like I’ve found my long time hairdresser!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
