  {
   "name": "places/ChIJKYDpLrmxe0gRdfdUbb4XPQs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rNVEyVnFPRlJPTFhkUGNuUlpNVTFvVG05eGVHYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I visited this salon a couple of weeks ago and just wanted to express how brilliant my appointment with Victoria was! I've been struggling with my hair for the past year (hair loss, growing back curly) and Victoria encouraged me to try train my curls, blow drying my hair with the diffuser for the first time. I've been continuing with her method/training and absolutely loving my hair!! Thank you so much, I'll be back\nSarah",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
